1. Executive Summary
1.1 Business Problem
In enterprise Accounts Payable (AP) automation, organizations receive invoices from vendors that must be matched to corresponding Purchase Order (PO) lines before payment can be processed. This matching is traditionally done manually.

1.2 Solution Overview
The Multi-Agent System is an intelligent, AI-powered solution that automatically performs strict 1:1 matching between Invoice Lines and PO Lines. It employs a Hybrid Multi-Agent Architecture combining:

Technique	Purpose
Rule-Based Matching	Exact matches on product codes
RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)	Semantic similarity matching
LLM Reasoning	Final decision with context
1.3 Key Capabilities
✅ Hybrid Matching: Combines rules + AI for best results
✅ 1:1 Enforcement: Guarantees no duplicate PO assignments
✅ Configurable: All thresholds and weights are tunable
✅ Retry Logic: Automatically retries unmatched items
✅ External Validation: Integrates with Salesforce for ERP validation
✅ Parallel Processing: Uses ThreadPoolExecutor for speed
