3.2 Orchestrator Agent
File: agents/orchestrator_agent.py

The Orchestrator Agent is an LLM-powered "Brain" that decides which plugins to execute and in what order.

Decision Logic:

If RULES == "yes":
    Execute: [InputDataHandler → RuleBasedPlugin → RAGAgent]
    
If RULES == "no":
    Execute: [InputDataHandler → RAGAgent]
Key Features:

Uses Pydantic for response validation
Multiple parsing strategies for LLM output
Fallback to known plugin extraction
