3.4 Rule-Based Plugin
File: agents/plugins/rule_based_plugin.py

The "Fast Path" that handles exact matches before expensive AI processing.

Matching Rules:

Rule	Description	Example
Exact Field Match	Invoice field exactly equals PO field	INV.PartNo == PO.PartNo
Description Substring	Invoice value found in PO description	"ABC123" in PO.Description
Algorithm Flow:

Clean all text (remove special chars, lowercase)
Find unique values in each field
Attempt 1:1 matching on unique values only
Return matched pairs and remaining unmatched items
3.5 Retrieval Plugin
File: agents/plugins/retrieval_plugin.py

Handles vector storage and hybrid retrieval.

Hybrid Search Formula:

hybrid_score = (weight_embedding × cosine_similarity) + (weight_keyword × keyword_overlap)

Default weights:
- weight_embedding = 0.8
- weight_keyword = 0.01
Key Functions:

initialize_vector_store(): Creates in-memory vector store
store_documents(): Adds PO embeddings to store
retrieve_documents(): Performs MMR + hybrid search
delete_documents(): Removes matched PO lines
3.6 Salesforce Plugin
File: agents/plugins/salesforce_plugin.py

External validation against the ERP system.

Authentication Flow:

Check for cached access token
If not present, authenticate using OAuth password grant
Cache token for subsequent calls
Handle 401 (token expired) gracefully
